Modifications for text_auto_wrap (2026): translated TypeScript inference and
model tables to Dart; adapted the BoundaryPredictor API; added typed model
validation and immutable map/result snapshots; explicitly clamped UTF-16
substring windows. All bundled feature strings and integer weights are
preserved. Preset adapters map source whitespace-run starts to the permitted
UTF-16 run-end offsets used by this package and filter other raw predictions.

Preset names and penalties follow packages/en/MODEL_CARD.md and
packages/ko/MODEL_CARD.md. Regression examples are adapted from the language
packages' README.md, README-ko_kr.md, and tests/en.test.ts or tests/ko.test.ts.
The bundled title-model weights are semantic-wrap work by Woohyun Park;
they are not Google-trained language models.

